* @title Gimpel CODE function test
* @attribution James F. Gimpel, Algorithms in SNOBOL4, TEST_CODE.SNO; Catspaw SNOBOL4+ program diskette
* @expect >>>
* CODE
* CODE OK
* <<<
	OUTPUT = CODE(" X = 1 ")        :S(OK)F(ERR)
OK	OUTPUT = "CODE OK"              :(END)
ERR	OUTPUT = "CODE FAIL"            :(END)
END
